@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC12: Lihat Laporan Keuangan
autonumber

actor "Admin / Bendahara" as Admin
boundary "UI_LaporanKeuangan" as UI
control "Control_LaporanKeuangan" as Control
entity "T_Tagihan" as E_Tagihan
entity "T_Pembayaran" as E_Pembayaran

== Skenario: Laporan Pembayaran Masuk ==

Admin -> UI : 1. Pilih Sub-Menu "Laporan Pembayaran"
activate UI
UI --> Admin : 2. Tampilkan Form Filter (Tgl Awal, Tgl Akhir, Status)

Admin -> UI : 3. Masukkan Filter & Klik "Tampilkan"
UI -> Control : 4. RequestLaporanPembayaran(Filter)
activate Control

Control -> E_Pembayaran : 5. GetPembayaranByFilter(Filter)
activate E_Pembayaran
E_Pembayaran --> Control : 6. Return Data Laporan
deactivate E_Pembayaran

Control --> UI : 7. Render Laporan Pembayaran
deactivate Control
UI --> Admin : 8. Tampilkan Tabel Laporan
deactivate UI

== Skenario: Rekapitulasi Tagihan ==

Admin -> UI : 9. Pilih Sub-Menu "Rekap Tagihan"
activate UI
UI --> Admin : 10. Tampilkan Form Filter (Tahun Ajaran, Kelas)

Admin -> UI : 11. Masukkan Filter & Klik "Tampilkan"
UI -> Control : 12. RequestRekapTagihan(Filter)
activate Control

Control -> E_Tagihan : 13. GetRekapTagihanByFilter(Filter)
activate E_Tagihan
E_Tagihan --> Control : 14. Return Data Rekap
deactivate E_Tagihan

Control --> UI : 15. Render Rekap Tagihan
deactivate Control
UI --> Admin : 16. Tampilkan Tabel Rekap Tagihan
deactivate UI

== Skenario: Data Siswa Belum Lunas ==

Admin -> UI : 17. Pilih Sub-Menu "Siswa Belum Lunas"
activate UI
UI --> Admin : 18. Tampilkan Form Filter (Bulan, Kelas)

Admin -> UI : 19. Masukkan Filter & Klik "Tampilkan"
UI -> Control : 20. RequestSiswaBelumLunas(Filter)
activate Control

Control -> E_Tagihan : 21. GetSiswaBelumLunas(Filter)
activate E_Tagihan
E_Tagihan --> Control : 22. Return Data Siswa
deactivate E_Tagihan

Control --> UI : 23. Render Data Siswa
deactivate Control
UI --> Admin : 24. Tampilkan Tabel Siswa Belum Lunas
deactivate UI

== Skenario: Ekspor / Cetak Laporan (PDF/Excel) ==

Admin -> UI : 25. Klik Tombol "Ekspor (PDF/Excel)" pada Laporan Aktif
activate UI
UI -> Control : 26. GenerateExportFile(Format, Filter)
activate Control

Control -> Control : 27. Format Data menjadi Dokumen (PDF/Excel)
Control --> UI : 28. Return URL Download / File Stream
deactivate Control

UI --> Admin : 29. Otomatis Mengunduh File Laporan
deactivate UI

@enduml
